  "solution": "Given equation: 112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 8 × 12 = 64.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 8 × 12 = 64\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 112 - 14 + __**40 ÷ 8**__ × 12 = 64\n\n⇒ 112 - 14 + __**5 × 12**__ = 64\n\n⇒ __**112**__ - 14 __**+ 60**__ = 64\n\n⇒ __172 - 14__ = 64\n\n⇒ 158 ≠ 64\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and ×\n\nGiven: 112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 8 × 12 = 64\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 112 - __**14 ÷ 40 × 8**__ + 12 = 64\n\n⇒ __**112**__ - 2.8 __**+ 12**__ = 64\n\n⇒ __124 -____ 2.8__ = 64\n\n⇒ 121.2 ≠ 64\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) ÷ and -**\n\nGiven: 112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 8 × 12 = 64\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**112 ÷ 14**__ - 40 + 8 × 12 = 64 \n\n⇒ 8 - 40 + __**8 × 12**__ = 64 \n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 40 __**+ 96**__ = 64 \n\n⇒ __104 - 40__ = 64\n\n**⇒ 64 = 64**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) - and +\n\nGiven: 112 - 14 ÷ 40 + 8 × 12 = 64\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 112 + __**14 ÷ 40**__ - 8 × 12 = 64\n\n⇒ 112 + 0.35 - __**8 × 12**__ = 64\n\n⇒ __**112 + 0.35**__ - 96 = 64\n\n⇒ __112.35____ - 96__ = 64\n\n⇒ 16.35 ≠ 64\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
